{"id": "pf.k00022", "source": "facial_expression", "kind": "cue", "text": "The superorbital ridges appear as two arched mounds protruding from the lower edge of the forehead plane.", "condition": "", "quote": "", "about": ["feature:brow"], "loc": "c11-0008", "from": "ebook_maker kb/character-portrait", "status": "active"}
{"id": "pf.k00025", "source": "facial_expression", "kind": "rule", "text": "Show a smooth transition from the forehead to the nose to indicate a female sex.", "condition": "in the absence of a strong brow ridge", "quote": "", "about": ["feature:forehead", "sex:female"], "loc": "c12-0015", "from": "ebook_maker kb/character-portrait", "status": "active"}
{"id": "pf.k00026", "source": "facial_expression", "kind": "rule", "text": "Depict a more sloped forehead to indicate a male sex.", "condition": "", "quote": "", "about": ["feature:forehead", "sex:male"], "loc": "c12-0015", "from": "ebook_maker kb/character-portrait", "status": "active"}
{"id": "pf.k00035", "source": "facial_expression", "kind": "cue", "text": "A thin, upright stem following the outer rim of the eye socket indicates a thin person.", "condition": "", "quote": "", "about": ["feature:cheek"], "loc": "c13-0011", "from": "ebook_maker kb/character-portrait", "status": "active"}
{"id": "pf.k00036", "source": "facial_expression", "kind": "cue", "text": "A thick fatty pad located just below the cheekbones softens the lower face.", "condition": "", "quote": "", "about": ["feature:cheek"], "loc": "c13-0009", "from": "ebook_maker kb/character-portrait", "status": "active"}
{"id": "pf.k00041", "source": "facial_expression", "kind": "rule", "text": "Render the chin mound as ball-like, potentially including a central groove.", "condition": "", "quote": "", "about": ["feature:jaw"], "loc": "c14-0025", "from": "ebook_maker kb/character-portrait", "status": "active"}
{"id": "pf.k00049", "source": "facial_expression", "kind": "rule", "text": "High cheekbones are characterized by a shadow caused by a lack of cheek fat underneath the prominent mound of the zygomatic arch.", "condition": "", "quote": "", "about": ["feature:cheek", "feature:skin"], "loc": "c14-0045", "from": "ebook_maker kb/character-portrait", "status": "active"}
{"id": "pf.k00052", "source": "facial_expression", "kind": "cue", "text": "A jawline that disappears after the chin and is only sensed under the surface indicates a less prominent jaw structure.", "condition": "", "quote": "", "about": ["feature:jaw"], "loc": "c14-0037", "from": "ebook_maker kb/character-portrait", "status": "active"}
{"id": "pf.k00072", "source": "facial_expression", "kind": "rule", "text": "Depict eyes as deep-set by reducing the fullness of the fat pad underneath the eyeball.", "condition": "", "quote": "", "about": ["feature:eyes", "feature:skin"], "loc": "c17-0014", "from": "ebook_maker kb/character-portrait", "status": "active"}
{"id": "pf.k00075", "source": "facial_expression", "kind": "rule", "text": "On Asiatic eyes, hide the inner eye corner with a skin fold.", "condition": "", "quote": "", "about": ["feature:eyes", "feature:skin"], "loc": "c17-0014", "from": "ebook_maker kb/character-portrait", "status": "active"}
{"id": "pf.k00103", "source": "facial_expression", "kind": "cue", "text": "Deepening of the nasolabial fold, which runs from the nose to the outer corner of the mouth, signals aging.", "condition": "", "quote": "", "about": ["feature:skin", "age:elderly"], "loc": "c20-0008", "from": "ebook_maker kb/character-portrait", "status": "active"}
{"id": "pf.k00109", "source": "facial_expression", "kind": "rule", "text": "The nasolabial fold, the crease between the cheek and upper lip, deepens as the subject ages.", "condition": "", "quote": "", "about": ["feature:skin", "age:elderly"], "loc": "c20-0019", "from": "ebook_maker kb/character-portrait", "status": "active"}
{"id": "pf.k00111", "source": "facial_expression", "kind": "rule", "text": "The lips thin and lose their shapely form as the subject ages.", "condition": "", "quote": "", "about": ["feature:lips", "age:elderly"], "loc": "c20-0023", "from": "ebook_maker kb/character-portrait", "status": "active"}
{"id": "pf.k00140", "source": "facial_expression", "kind": "rule", "text": "Depict older faces with a more complex pattern of wrinkles where many lines are permanent and only deepen during expression.", "condition": "", "quote": "", "about": ["age:elderly", "feature:skin"], "loc": "c22-0033", "from": "ebook_maker kb/character-portrait", "status": "active"}
{"id": "pf.k00147", "source": "facial_expression", "kind": "rule", "text": "Depict vertical creases between the eyebrows to signal a history of frowning.", "condition": "", "quote": "", "about": ["feature:brow", "feature:skin"], "loc": "c22-0050", "from": "ebook_maker kb/character-portrait", "status": "active"}
{"id": "pf.k00148", "source": "facial_expression", "kind": "rule", "text": "Include crow's feet around the eyes, noting they can result from frequent smiling or from squinting in bright light.", "condition": "", "quote": "", "about": ["feature:eyes", "feature:skin"], "loc": "c22-0050", "from": "ebook_maker kb/character-portrait", "status": "active"}
{"id": "pf.k00174", "source": "facial_expression", "kind": "rule", "text": "Depict male eyebrows as heavier and closer to the eye than female eyebrows.", "condition": "", "quote": "", "about": ["feature:hair", "sex:male"], "loc": "c23-0031", "from": "ebook_maker kb/character-portrait", "status": "active"}
{"id": "pf.k00175", "source": "facial_expression", "kind": "rule", "text": "Depict female eyebrows as thinner and higher than male eyebrows.", "condition": "", "quote": "", "about": ["feature:hair", "sex:female"], "loc": "c23-0031", "from": "ebook_maker kb/character-portrait", "status": "active"}
{"id": "pf.k00176", "source": "facial_expression", "kind": "rule", "text": "Position the male eyebrow on the downslope of the eyebrow ridge.", "condition": "", "quote": "", "about": ["feature:hair", "sex:male"], "loc": "c23-0031", "from": "ebook_maker kb/character-portrait", "status": "active"}
{"id": "pf.k00177", "source": "facial_expression", "kind": "rule", "text": "Position the female eyebrow on the upslope of the eyebrow ridge.", "condition": "", "quote": "", "about": ["feature:hair", "sex:female"], "loc": "c23-0031", "from": "ebook_maker kb/character-portrait", "status": "active"}
{"id": "pf.k00194", "source": "facial_expression", "kind": "rule", "text": "Depict horizontal, wave-shaped forehead wrinkles to suggest an older age or frequent conversational expression.", "condition": "", "quote": "", "about": ["age:elderly", "feature:skin"], "loc": "c24-0018", "from": "ebook_maker kb/character-portrait", "status": "active"}
{"id": "pf.k00208", "source": "facial_expression", "kind": "cue", "text": "Deep vertical wrinkles between the eyebrows are often permanently etched into the faces of older people, especially men.", "condition": "", "quote": "", "about": ["age:elderly", "feature:skin"], "loc": "c25-0011", "from": "ebook_maker kb/character-portrait", "status": "active"}
{"id": "pf.k00220", "source": "facial_expression", "kind": "cue", "text": "The iris is exactly half hidden by the upper lid.", "condition": "", "quote": "", "about": ["trait:sleepy", "feature:eyes"], "loc": "c26-0019", "from": "ebook_maker kb/character-portrait", "status": "active"}
{"id": "pf.k00312", "source": "facial_expression", "kind": "rule", "text": "Depict a straight across mouth as a flattened Cupid's bow where the dip and two peaks are barely evident.", "condition": "", "quote": "", "about": ["feature:lips"], "loc": "c31-0016", "from": "ebook_maker kb/character-portrait", "status": "active"}
{"id": "pf.k00314", "source": "facial_expression", "kind": "rule", "text": "Depict aging by lengthening and deepening the crease at the mouth corner.", "condition": "", "quote": "", "about": ["age:elderly", "feature:skin"], "loc": "c31-0028", "from": "ebook_maker kb/character-portrait", "status": "active"}
{"id": "pf.k00323", "source": "facial_expression", "kind": "cue", "text": "Deep, lengthened creases at the corners of the mouth indicate an older age (around sixty).", "condition": "", "quote": "", "about": ["age:elderly", "feature:mouth", "feature:skin"], "loc": "c32-0006", "from": "ebook_maker kb/character-portrait", "status": "active"}
{"id": "pf.k00326", "source": "facial_expression", "kind": "cue", "text": "A fuller line of the jaw and a deeper crease under the mouth are signs of aging to sixty.", "condition": "", "quote": "", "about": ["age:elderly", "feature:jaw", "feature:skin"], "loc": "c32-0006", "from": "ebook_maker kb/character-portrait", "status": "active"}
{"id": "pf.k00375", "source": "facial_expression", "kind": "cue", "text": "Dimples are located on the side of the face and are usually deeper on one side than the other.", "condition": "", "quote": "", "about": ["feature:cheek"], "loc": "c34-0056", "from": "ebook_maker kb/character-portrait", "status": "active"}
{"id": "pf.k00987", "source": "facial_expression", "kind": "cue", "text": "Hollowing out of the eye-sockets and cheekbones suggests the aging process.", "condition": "", "quote": "", "about": ["age:elderly", "feature:cheek", "feature:head"], "loc": "c80-0030", "from": "ebook_maker kb/character-portrait", "status": "active"}
{"id": "pf.k01043", "source": "facial_expression", "kind": "cue", "text": "Grey hair on an elderly character can reinforce a persona of disdainful gentry.", "condition": "", "quote": "", "about": ["trait:snobbery", "feature:hair", "age:elderly"], "loc": "c84-0062", "from": "ebook_maker kb/character-portrait", "status": "active"}
{"id": "pf.k01191", "source": "facial_expression", "kind": "cue", "text": "A facial shrug of resignation is characterized by an exaggerated sad pout with the lower lip pushed outward, a radically downward-bent lower lip line, and roughened skin on the chin.", "condition": "", "quote": "", "about": ["trait:resignation", "feature:mouth", "feature:lips", "feature:skin"], "loc": "c93-0253", "from": "ebook_maker kb/character-portrait", "status": "active"}
